snippet.description:
When a father returned home, he found his daughter eating nothing but a piece of bread. The truth behind her tears shocked him: his girlfriend had punished her for showing kindness to someone in need. But when he discovered that even her own son was afraid of her, he had to make a choice. Sometimes, the greatest lesson parents can teach their children is kindness. ❤️

